. 2d 852</a></span>; No. 84-6036, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2460932\"><a href=\"/opinion/2460932/garrett-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Garrett v. State\">682 S. W. 2d 301</a></span>; No. 84-6098, <span class=\"citation multiple-matches\"><a href=\"/c/S.%20W.%202d/676/364/\">676 S. W. 2d 364</a></span>; No. 84-6131, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9855448\"><a href=\"/opinion/1298138/devier-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Devier v. State\">253 Ga. 604</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9855448\"><a href=\"/opinion/1298138/devier-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Devier v. State\">323 S. E. 2d 150</a></span>; No. 84-6167, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1845060\"><a href=\"/opinion/1845060/groover-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Groover v. State\">458 So. 2d 226</a></span>; No. 84-6183, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9578502\"><a href=\"/opinion/1319912/state-v-huffstetler/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Huffstetler\">312 N. C. 92</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9578502\"><a href=\"/opinion/1319912/state-v-huffstetler/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Huffstetler\">322 S. E. 2d 110</a></span>; Nos. 84-6186 and 84-6189, 285 S. C. 21, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1227338\"><a href=\"/opinion/1227338/state-v-chaffee/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Chaffee\">328 S. E. 2d 464</a></span>; No. 84-6223, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1693914\"><a href=\"/opinion/1693914/ex-parte-daniel/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Ex Parte Daniel\">459 So. 2d 948</a></span>; No. 84-6230, 285 S. C. 13, <span class=\"citation multiple-matches\"><a href=\"/c/S.%20E.%202d/328/53/\">328 S. E. 2d 53</a></span>; No. 84-6254, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9776044\"><a href=\"/opinion/2452649/state-v-bannister/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Bannister\">680 S. W. 2d 141</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9047007,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":596,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b943-17\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"A_8\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b943-18\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}